flowchart TD
    Failure[Failure, corruption or exercise] --> Protect[Stop unsafe writes; protect evidence, backups and clean identity]
    Protect --> Assess{HA fault, logical corruption or compromise?}
    Assess -->|Healthy standby| Failover[Fail over and fence old writer]
    Assess -->|Corruption/outage| Restore[Isolated point-in-time restore]
    Assess -->|Compromise| Clean[Security containment and clean control plane]
    Clean --> Restore
    Restore --> Validate[Schema, constraints, RLS, keys, objects, audit, deletion/hold]
    Failover --> Validate
    Validate --> Reconcile[Devices, manual sheets, providers and unknown outcomes]
    Reconcile --> Cutover[Phased reads/writes and monitored cutover]
    Cutover --> Verify{Task, integrity, RPO/RTO and backlog acceptable?}
    Verify -- No --> Assess
    Verify -- Yes --> Close[Merchant communication, cleanup, exercise/incident learning]

